  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"_2\" id=\"_2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u863e9f88\" id=\"u863e9f88\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">力荐软件</span></h3><ul list=\"uc5b9e770\"><li fid=\"u31ad53e8\" data-lake-id=\"u505cdfb0\" id=\"u505cdfb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab071b83\" id=\"uab071b83\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">apt-fast：更快速的软件管理</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u1f98e7d2\" id=\"u1f98e7d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7c281a2\" id=\"uf7c281a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">安装过程会进入一个图形界面，配置线程数等信息，全部默认即可</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20add-apt-repository%20ppa%3Aapt-fast%2Fstable%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20update%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20-y%20install%20apt-fast%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y3uaa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u32f348b2\" id=\"u32f348b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07391a58\" id=\"u07391a58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">以后安装应用，把</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf41fa6f0\" id=\"uf41fa6f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua322b034\" id=\"ua322b034\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 71, 79)\">apt-get</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uadd7f745\" id=\"uadd7f745\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">直接替换成</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubd958516\" id=\"ubd958516\"><span data-lake-id=\"u716f931e\" id=\"u716f931e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 71, 79)\">apt-fast</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufa8854c6\" id=\"ufa8854c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">即可，例如安装vlc</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt-fast%20install%20vlc%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22MDyoy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u5103d17a\"><li fid=\"u7c892289\" data-lake-id=\"u51bc8889\" id=\"u51bc8889\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89953440\" id=\"u89953440\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">vlc万能播放器：支持倍速播放</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt-get%20install%20vlc%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22sBFJp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u920cdc38\"><li fid=\"u2f4796a9\" data-lake-id=\"ucae89e7e\" id=\"ucae89e7e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79414655\" id=\"u79414655\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">terminator多tab终端：黑客必备</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22